BT /F1 11 Tf 50 678 Td (Dimensional analysis checks an equation by comparing the dimensions on both sides: `[v] = L T^-1` and `[a] = L T^-2`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 662 Td (A measurement of 25.4 mm is the same as 2.54 cm and 0.0254 m.) Tj ET
endstream
