stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 790 Td (PHYS 201  Mechanics and Thermal Physics) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 774 Td (Page 23 of 60) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 758 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 742 Td (## 14. Gases and the kinetic model) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 726 Td (The ideal gas equation is `PV = nRT`, with R = 8.314 J/\(mol K\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 710 Td (For a fixed mass at constant temperature, `P1V1 = P2V2` \(Boyle's law\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 694 Td (At constant pressure, `V1/T1 = V2/T2` \(Charles's law\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 678 Td (Temperature in the gas laws must be in kelvin, where 0 degrees Celsius is 273 K.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 662 Td (The kinetic model says pressure comes from molecules colliding with the walls.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
